Changes in v2:
- Drop 'extern' from new function prototypes (Bart Van Assche)
- Fix kerneldoc to use 'Return:' format (Bart Van Assche)
- Use <linux/device/devres.h> instead of <linux/device.h> (Andy Shevchenko)

